  "compare": [
    {
      "words": "floor, story, storey",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "c1",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "表示“在几层楼”，用 floor。比较英美关于楼层的不同说法："
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c2",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "一楼 the first floor〈美〉, the ground floor〈英〉"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c3",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "二楼 the second floor〈美〉, the first floor〈英〉"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c4",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "表示“楼房有多少层”时，用 story 或 storey，其复数形式分别为 stories 和 storeys。storey 为英国拼法，story 为美国拼法。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c5",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "There are three "
            },
            {
              "t": "underline",
              "v": "storeys"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " including the ground floor. 包括底层在内一共有三层。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
